@startuml Artifact Multimedia SequenceDiagram
actor Visitor
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Backend API" as API

database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Visitor -> App: Request artifact multimedia

App -> API: GET /api/artifacts/{artifactId}/multimedia

API -> DB: Retrieve Multimedia resources
DB --> API: Multimedia data

API --> App: Multimedia response

App --> Visitor: Display multimedia content

@enduml



